{"html": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SUMO.</strong> ON. YOUR. COUCH. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In FULL CONTACT, take control of an underground sumo wrestler to battle it out with your real-life friends. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW TO PLAY ONLINE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online play is available through Steam Remote Play Together. In game, press Shift+Tab, click on your friend's profile, and select Remote Play Together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up and play with an <strong>accessible 3-button control scheme while you hype up the crowd</strong> and <strong>increase your hype meter</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/7cd647473b02decef90d0ba4dd2d0089.poster.avif?t=1754418539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/7cd647473b02decef90d0ba4dd2d0089.webm?t=1754418539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER 4 UNIQUE CHARACTERS:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>RICKY C.</u></strong><u>: THE 11th GENERATION CHAMPION</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/6c41b5c66d5fe73c968857b7977acbc7.avif?t=1754418539\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLAM:</strong> Standard, pushes enemies back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL:</strong> Quick Dash.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>8-BALL</u></strong><u>: FUNKY ROBO-DANCER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/de1d452f1a6b8bb1621b7dc4b9e9a075.avif?t=1754418539\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLAM:</strong> Head spin, increases movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL:</strong> Stylish Taunt. Builds hype when up close.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>BELO</u></strong><u>: BUSINESS BEAR</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/54903f8f5351477ed6a2a605351c3ab8.avif?t=1754418539\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLAM:</strong> Hold to charge up for a more powerful strike.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL:</strong> Hold to gain armor.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>CARRIE</u></strong><u>: HAUNTED ROOKIE</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/fa129249ee5fc9a147950d35132d2649.avif?t=1754418539\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLAM:</strong> Can be used to knock ghosts around.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPECIAL:</strong> Summon a ghost that slams the enemy on hit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duke it out across <strong>4 hand-drawn stages</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/4f9545c9dcd8cc3728454b2a463aa67e.avif?t=1754418539\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slam your friends into the stratosphere</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/36d268806f89924ffacdade4e708cb26.poster.avif?t=1754418539\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/36d268806f89924ffacdade4e708cb26.webm?t=1754418539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>"}